WEBVTT

00:02:28.954 --> 00:02:31.746
School without school has been traumatic,

00:02:31.746 --> 00:02:33.788
it's been makeshift, it's been messy.

00:02:34.329 --> 00:02:37.788
Parents, teachers and students
have fumbled with tech,

00:02:37.788 --> 00:02:39.788
fumbled even more with expectations.

00:02:40.371 --> 00:02:41.871
And we've lost so much.

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:44.288
And maybe,

00:02:44.829 --> 00:02:46.246
just maybe,

00:02:46.288 --> 00:02:49.413
stripped bare like it's been,
we can see more.

00:02:50.579 --> 00:02:53.746
When words like "rigor," "grit"

00:02:53.746 --> 00:02:55.913
and a half dozen
other educational hashtags

00:02:55.954 --> 00:02:57.496
don't seem to matter,

00:02:57.496 --> 00:02:59.913
we can see what's in front of us
with new clarity.